<section class="landing-showcase">
  <div class="landing-container">
    <div class="landing-showcase-head">
      <span class="landing-showcase-eyebrow">Declaration vs storage</span>
      <h2 class="landing-section-title">Keep secret names separate from storage.</h2>
      <p class="landing-section-lead landing-section-lead-narrow">
        Keep the declaration in your repository while each developer, CI job, or deployment chooses an appropriate provider. The application still receives the same variables.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-secret">
      <div>
        <div class="landing-provider-tabs" id="secret-tabs">
          <button type="button" class="landing-provider-tab is-active" data-provider="keyring">Keyring</button>
          <button type="button" class="landing-provider-tab" data-provider="onepassword">1Password</button>
